;; Class 28 - the `affine` marker on a proposition. Proofs are erased and
;; always duplicable, so an affine proposition would be silently ignored;
;; the kernel rejects the declaration instead (T4 finding F4).
;; Expected: kernel K0052 (AffineCopyConflict).
(inductive (affine) Perm (sort 0) (ctor grant Perm))
